stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OPEN
  OPEN --> CLASSIFIED: type + scope + rationale
  CLASSIFIED --> RESOLVING: deterministic / knowledge path
  CLASSIFIED --> ASSIGNED: owner or expert route
  RESOLVING --> ANSWER_CANDIDATE: answer + assurance + evidence
  RESOLVING --> WAITING_FOR_EVIDENCE: source missing
  RESOLVING --> ASSIGNED: human knowledge needed
  ANSWER_CANDIDATE --> RESOLVED: supported outcome
  ANSWER_CANDIDATE --> WAITING_FOR_EVIDENCE: insufficient or conflicted
  ASSIGNED --> RESOLVING: response received
  ASSIGNED --> WAITING_FOR_EVIDENCE: evidence requested
  WAITING_FOR_EVIDENCE --> RESOLVING: evidence received
  WAITING_FOR_EVIDENCE --> ESCALATED: authority or impact
  ESCALATED --> ASSIGNED: responder selected
  CLASSIFIED --> DEFERRED: trigger recorded
  WAITING_FOR_EVIDENCE --> DEFERRED: trigger recorded
  DEFERRED --> OPEN: trigger satisfied
  RESOLVED --> OBSOLETE: superseded or no longer applicable
  OPEN --> OBSOLETE: duplicate or superseded

